WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.716 --> 00:00:05.358
<v Maya>How do I make Pip move?

2
00:00:05.823 --> 00:00:09.492
<v Ms. Nova>Open the Drive tab and try a pose button. Let's press Wave up!

3
00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.658
<v Maya>It waved! I can see it in the 3D view, too.

4
00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:18.130
<v Ms. Nova>Each joint has its own card. Press plus to turn it ten degrees. Zero is the middle.

5
00:00:18.599 --> 00:00:20.049
<v Maya>Can I open the hand?

6
00:00:20.504 --> 00:00:24.920
<v Ms. Nova>Press Open, then Close. In real life, only grab soft and light things.

7
00:00:26.097 --> 00:00:27.611
<v Maya>And Home puts it back?

8
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:33.292
<v Ms. Nova>Exactly! Start on slow speed while you practice. You're a robot pilot now.
